        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-5251, Ridged Melon Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half Melon Cup Pull has a lovely shape that brings elegance to any space. It features a classic design, but what sets this cabinet pull apart from similar shaped hardware is the wide array of finishes in which it is available. Each of the 7 finishes are beautiful and grant their own aura to this melon-shaped cabinet cup pull. This melon cup pull made by RK International has a 3 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3249\"><b>CK-3249 Melon Cabinet Knob With Button Center</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/smooth-melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3250\"><b>CK-3250 Melon Cabinet Knob With Smooth Center</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-5251 Melon Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Production: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
